      "known_issue": "defence cap: VCMI parses the JSON literal 0.7 by accumulating 0.1*7 (lib/json/JsonParser.cpp:536-547), yielding 0.7000000000000001 \u2014 one ULP above the double 0.7 that homm3_model.py's Python literal 0.7 denotes. The engine therefore multiplies by 0.29999999999999993 where the model multiplies by 0.30000000000000004, and std::floor drops one point of damage whenever base x 0.3 is an exact integer. Only the defence cap is affected; 0.05, 4.0 and 0.025 round identically either way."
    },
